  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-kanban>",
      "lede": "Tablero kanban con columnas y tarjetas. Cada columna tiene un accent\r\n          color, badge automático con el conteo, slots de header-actions y\r\n          cards con cover, heading, meta, tag y footer.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-kanban id=\"kb1\">\r\n            <is-kanban-column title=\"Pending\" accent=\"dodgerblue\">\r\n              <is-kanban-card heading=\"Diseñar landing\" meta=\"Asignado a Ana\" tag=\"Design\" tag-color=\"brand\">\r\n                Maquetar la nueva landing con el sistema de paneles.\r\n              </is-kanban-card>\r\n              <is-kanban-card heading=\"Investigar SSO\" meta=\"Asignado a Diego\" tag=\"R&amp;D\" tag-color=\"warning\">\r\n                Contactar con Auth0 y Okta para comparar planes.\r\n              </is-kanban-card>\r\n              <is-kanban-card heading=\"Newsletter mensual\" meta=\"Pendiente de copy\" tag=\"Marketing\" tag-color=\"neutral\">\r\n                Preparar el email de finales de mes.\r\n              </is-kanban-card>\r\n            </is-kanban-column>\r\n            <is-kanban-column title=\"In progress\" accent=\"var(--is-warning, #ffa800)\">\r\n              <is-kanban-card heading=\"Implementar /api/v2\" meta=\"Backend ⋅ 70%\" tag=\"Backend\" tag-color=\"warning\">\r\n                <span slot=\"footer\">\r\n                  <is-icon icon=\"mdi:clock-outline\"></is-icon>\r\n                  <span>3 días</span>\r\n                </span>\r\n              </is-kanban-card>\r\n              <is-kanban-card heading=\"Bug: scrollspy\" meta=\"Frontend\" tag=\"Frontend\" tag-color=\"brand\">\r\n                El observer no se desconecta al cambiar de pestaña.\r\n              </is-kanban-card>\r\n            </is-kanban-column>\r\n            <is-kanban-column title=\"QA\" accent=\"var(--is-success, #0bb783)\">\r\n              <is-kanban-card heading=\"Refactor pagination\" meta=\"PR #429\" tag=\"Refactor\" tag-color=\"success\">\r\n                Sustituir el paginador custom por is-pagination.\r\n              </is-kanban-card>\r\n            </is-kanban-column>\r\n            <is-kanban-column title=\"Done\" accent=\"var(--is-success, #0bb783)\">\r\n              <is-kanban-card heading=\"Calendar widget\" tag=\"UI\" tag-color=\"success\">Componente terminado y desplegado.</is-kanban-card>\r\n            </is-kanban-column>\r\n          </is-kanban>\r\n          <p id=\"kLog\">Click sobre una card: <code class=\"code\">—</code></p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-kanban></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-kanban-column</span> <span class=\"attr\">title</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Pending\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">accent</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"dodgerblue\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>\r\n    <span class=\"tag\"><is-kanban-card</span> <span class=\"attr\">heading</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Diseñar landing\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">tag</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Design\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>…<span class=\"tag\"></is-kanban-card></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"></is-kanban-column></span>\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></is-kanban></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cover",
